    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like it's not even about \"making choices.\" like, what if the cycle is just... inevitable? it feels like if i keep going, i'm just passing this misery onto the next person. every time i try to be happy, it just decays back into the same old pattern. it's like i'm just a carrier for this thing, and it's exhausting.",
